"description": "National Vision Holdings, Inc. engages in the retail of optical products. It operates through the following segments: Owned and Host, Legacy, and Corporate and Other. The Owned and Host segment offers America\u2019s Best and Eyeglass World brands. The Legacy segment includes inventory and lab processing services. The Corporate and Other segment relates to the results of operations of the other operating segments and corporate overhead support. The company was founded in 1990 and is headquartered in Lawrenceville, GA.",
